    <profile name="Daemonic Possession" id="9e83-b844-22a3-c943" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Reduces the BS to 3. Ignores Crew shaken and stunned results on a 2+ (embarked models remain affected). Roll a D6 each time a model embarks/disembarks. On a 1 it eats a random model (with no saves allowed) and regains a Hull Point.</characteristic>
