      <rules>
        <rule name="Chosen of Khorne" id="4fbb-99b1-5a96-17e6" hidden="false">
          <description>If this formation is the Primary Detachment, then you may re-roll the Warlord result.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Lord of the Blood Host" id="687d-6f08-f1af-0dcc" hidden="false">
          <description>If this formation&apos;s HQ is in Deep Strike Reserve, you may re-roll the units reserve roll. If any of other units are placed within 6&quot; of the HQ&apos;s Deep strike location, they may deep strike without scatter (including the turn he entered in).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Blood Host Unleashed" id="cfdf-3867-0e04-2ae1" hidden="false">
          <description>Enemy units suffer a -2 penalty to fear tests against units in this formation.</description>
