        <rule name="Fighter Ace" id="ed80-c098-9142-e917" hidden="false">
          <description>d6 Results
1-2 Crack Shot: Fighter Ace has +1BS
3-4 Evasive Manoeuvers: Improves cover save by1 (to a max cover save of 3+)
5-6 Inspiring Aircraft: Fighter Ace and all friendly units within 12&quot; of the model that are the same Faction have Fearless.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Fist of Khorne" id="9078-23ca-af6a-d83a" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Meteroic Descent" id="cba4-5f47-3bf7-fb36" hidden="false">
          <description>If the formations Kharybdis Assault Claw lands on an enemy vehicle or building when it arrives by Deep strike, do not roll on the Deep Strike Mishap table. Instead, each vehicle or building struck by it suffers a single Strength D AP1 hit. After any hits have been resolved, the Kharybdis Assault Claw is placed as close as possible to its final position and suffers an Immobilised result on the Vehicle Damage table.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Hungry for Blood" id="819a-3438-ad98-c8ad" hidden="false">
          <description>The bezerkers must begin the game inside the Kharybdis. The unit may charge on the same turn they disembark the Kharybdis.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
