          <description>If this formation is the Primary detachment, you may re-roll the result of the Warlord Traits table.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Blood Sacrifice" id="aba9-e293-13d6-9122" hidden="false">
          <description>If a cultist unit fails a morale check, you can choose to remove the remaining models as casualties.</description>
