        <rule name="Boon of Khorne" id="75aa-b546-33b4-a794" hidden="false">
          <description>When you choose a Blood Tithe result on the table, select a second Tithe (that is both under 4 Tithe&apos;s and under the original Tithe reward) and that Tithe is applied as well. The second Tithe affects all units in the formation and lasts until end of turn.</description>
